			<div class="col-sm-8">
				<h3>LineDriver Attachment</h3>
				<p>Why walk when you can ride? Only Graco offers two high performance LineDrivers (<a href="~/store/new-graco-linedriver-ride-on-attachment-for-linelazer-iv">LineDriver</a> and <a href="~/store/graco-linedriver-hd-ride-on-attachment-for-linelazer-iv">LineDriver HD</a>) to connect to your GrindLazer to help you double your line removing applications. The LineDriver and LineDriver HD provides the most innovative, user-friendly ride-on systems for the professional line removal contractor in the industry.</p>
				<p>Get higher productivity, straighter inlay and line removal with less fatigue.</p>
                <p>GrindLazer HP DC1021 G with Reverse/ &quot;Up-Cut&quot; cutting direction requires the use of a LineDriver Propel System. The GrindLazer 480 unit cannot operate without a LineDriver due to the ProStart safety switch interlock system.</p>
